# JetBrains Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# ========== Build Artifacts ==========
# Unity builds
*.apk
*.aab
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcuserdata/
*.ipa
*.app
*.exe
*.dll
*.manifest
*.log
*.mp4
