# ========== Crash and Debug ==========
sysinfo.txt
*.stacktrace
*.crash
*.dmp

# ========== Other ==========
# Package manager cache
/[Pp]ackages/com.unity.package-manager*

# Ignore auto-generated Lighting data
/[Aa]ssets/**/LightingData.asset
/[Aa]ssets/**/Lightmap-*.exr
/[Aa]ssets/**/ReflectionProbe-*.exr
/[Aa]ssets/**/OcclusionCullingData.asset

# Ignore Addressables build cache
/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*
!/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*.meta

# ========== Optional ==========
